{"ts":"2026-08-16T02:15:03.674Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"7752eeaf5a7145ec7bd42151","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-16T02:15:03.674Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-16T02:15:03.674Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Design decision: comparability refusals are typed and ordered — a run with no recorded environment refuses with run_environment_unrecorded (undecidable), and differing environments refuse with environment_version_mismatch naming both runs and both environment ids. Metric diff is restricted to the intersection of the two runs' measured step spans; zero overlap reports common_step_range null rather than refusing, because an explicitly empty range is honest while only a cross-version diff is misleading. Config delta is computed from each run's recorded body fences (environment snapshot + run configuration), not assumed equal."}]}],"before_hash":"85bcbc169ea5ac7048891e5f1df586b76620bc98a1012c19f74556520500d652","after_hash":"aebe6594d3df4a7e6594bd3564b60377fb61c7d676a5275f9f013340dc102a39","item_hash_version":2}
